@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor 接待員 as RC
actor 管理員 as AD

rectangle 工廠訪客進出登記系統 {
  usecase "UC-01 登入" as UC01
  usecase "UC-02 登出" as UC02
  usecase "UC-03 查詢訪客" as UC03
  usecase "UC-04 建立訪客資料" as UC04
  usecase "UC-05 登記來訪" as UC05
  usecase "UC-06 檢視在廠訪客" as UC06
  usecase "UC-07 登記離廠" as UC07
  usecase "UC-08 查詢來訪紀錄" as UC08
  usecase "UC-09 修改來訪紀錄" as UC09
  usecase "UC-10 修改訪客資料" as UC10
  usecase "UC-11 維護員工名單" as UC11
  usecase "UC-12 維護訪客證" as UC12
  usecase "UC-13 管理帳號" as UC13
}

RC -- UC01
RC -- UC02
RC -- UC05
RC -- UC06
RC -- UC07
RC -- UC08
RC -- UC09
RC -- UC10
AD -- UC11
AD -- UC12
AD -- UC13
AD --|> RC

UC05 ..> UC03 : <<include>>
UC04 ..> UC05 : <<extend>>
note right of UC04
  條件：手機號碼
  查無訪客時
end note
@enduml
